  "description" : "The protagonist, Iwamori, was once a supreme powerhouse in the cultivation world, feared by villains, whose disciples were brutally slaughtered. Seeking revenge, Iwamori was inadvertently sealed away by their combined forces and transported to a world of superpowered individuals. Here, most people possess various superpowers; they are called \"heroes,\" constantly battling monsters and saving the world.\n　　Upon arriving in this superpowered world, Iwamori, unaware of the situation, was mistaken for a monster and attacked by the heroes. After several battles, the misunderstanding between Iwamori and the heroes gradually dissipates. Iwamori repeatedly saves the world from peril, becoming a new hero in this other world. His hero status also makes him an instructor at a superpowered school. While teaching his students his world`s cultivation system, he searches for a way to return to his original world. As he spends more time with his students, Iwamori`s long-dormant inner self begins to awaken. Unfortunately, the once peaceful superpowered world is disrupted by Iwamori`s arrival, as powerful beings from other worlds begin to invade…\nsource: movie.douban.com/googletranslate",
